add(['vectors architecture: factory routing'], 'VectorTypeFactory optimized wording describes generic fixed-vector selection, not specialized concrete types.', 'confirmed-source','P3 opportunity','API clarity','public factory',['Sources/VectorCore/Factory/VectorTypeFactory.swift:28','Sources/VectorCore/Factory/VectorTypeFactory.swift:51'], 'Factory switch constructs Vector<Dim*> for supported sizes; existing tests intentionally require these concrete outputs.', 'No measured performance regression. Changing the output type can alter casts, provider routing and generic overload behavior.', 'Document actual outputs and benchmark target workloads before deciding strategy; preserve compatibility or explicitly version change.', 'Concrete-output and routing tests remain deliberate; any strategy change reruns all reachable kernels and consumer casts at every supported dimension.',[])
